Generic single-database configuration.

The database URL is not stored here: `alembic/env.py` reads it from the
application settings (`FASTAPI_DATABASE_URL`), so migrations always target
the same database as the service.

Useful commands:

    uv run alembic current                        # show the applied revision
    uv run alembic upgrade head                   # apply all migrations
    uv run alembic downgrade -1                   # roll back one revision
    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "x" # generate a new migration
